WEBVTT

00:07.896 --> 00:09.172
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.241 --> 00:10.862
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.931 --> 00:12.344
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.413 --> 00:14.310
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.379 --> 00:17.344
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.413 --> 00:19.448
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.517 --> 00:21.448
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.517 --> 00:23.344
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.413 --> 00:25.034
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.103 --> 00:27.482
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.551 --> 00:29.448
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.517 --> 00:31.413
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.482 --> 00:33.448
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.517 --> 00:35.310
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.379 --> 00:37.448
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.517 --> 00:39.551
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.620 --> 00:40.896
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.965 --> 00:42.758
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.827 --> 00:45.482
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.551 --> 00:47.793
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.862 --> 00:49.310
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.793 --> 00:54.724
[eerie music]
[诡异的音乐]

00:54.793 --> 01:01.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:01.482 --> 01:03.172
- All right, Science Scouts.
- 好吧，科学童子军。

01:03.241 --> 01:05.482
One last check on supplies.
最后一次检查物资。

01:05.551 --> 01:08.482
We all need to be prepared
for a campout on the Moon.
我们都需要做好准备
在月球上露营。

01:08.551 --> 01:11.896
SpongeBob.
- Hm. [humming]
海绵宝宝。
- 嗯。 [嗡嗡声]

01:11.965 --> 01:14.379
Six-pack of Fizz Bomb Cola.
[belching]
六罐汽水炸弹可乐。
[打嗝]

01:14.448 --> 01:16.655
Bubble wand.
泡泡棒。

01:16.724 --> 01:18.827
Mesh tank top.
[purrs]
网状背心。
[呼噜声]

01:18.896 --> 01:21.620
And I'm waiting on
a Krabby Patty delivery.
而我正在等待
蟹肉饼外卖。

01:21.689 --> 01:23.482
- Well, that's not
what I had in mind
- 嗯，那不是
我的想法

01:23.551 --> 01:25.034
when I said supplies.
当我说供应时。

01:25.103 --> 01:26.034
How 'bout you, Pearl?
你呢，珀尔？

01:26.103 --> 01:28.137
- Oh--pom-poms,
- 哦--pom-poms，

01:28.206 --> 01:31.620
megaphone
and spirit!
扩音器
和精神！

01:31.689 --> 01:32.620
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

01:32.689 --> 01:34.034
[all grunt]
[全都咕哝]

01:34.103 --> 01:37.241
- Uh. Do you always have to
rub it in my face
- 呃。你是否总是必须
把它擦在我脸上

01:37.310 --> 01:38.965
that you're a cheerleader?
你是啦啦队长？

01:39.034 --> 01:42.793
- Yes I do!
[blows raspberry]
- 是的，我愿意！
[吹覆盆子]

01:42.862 --> 01:46.103
- Scouts, I don't think
you cotton to what we're doin'.
- 侦察兵，我不认为
你明白我们正在做的事情。

01:46.172 --> 01:49.931
We're going to the Moon!
我们要去月球！

01:50.000 --> 01:51.793
all: Eww!
所有人：哎哟！

01:51.862 --> 01:53.344
- Huh? Mm.
- 啊？毫米。

01:53.413 --> 01:55.137
[slurps]
[scoffs]
[啜饮]
[嘲笑]

01:55.206 --> 01:59.000
- No, that Moon.
[spacey music]
- 不，是那个月亮。
[太空音乐]

01:59.068 --> 02:01.275
all: Ohh!
全体：噢！

02:01.344 --> 02:02.793
- Squidina,
what did you bring?
- 鱿鱼，
你带来了什么？

02:02.862 --> 02:07.379
- Eyeglasses, comic books
and action figures.
- 眼镜、漫画书
和动作人物。

02:07.448 --> 02:10.862
- Ugh, can a person
be any nerdier?
- 呃，一个人可以吗
更书呆子吗？

02:10.931 --> 02:14.344
- I can.
- 我可以。

02:14.413 --> 02:17.172
- Ew!
- Remember, Scouts,
- 呃！
- 记住，侦察兵，

02:17.241 --> 02:18.448
we're scientists.
我们是科学家。

02:18.517 --> 02:19.551
Let's behave like it.
让我们像这样行事吧。

02:19.620 --> 02:20.551
[blowing]
[bubbles popping]
[吹]
[气泡破裂]

02:20.620 --> 02:22.689
Hm!
- [humming]
嗯！
- [嗡嗡声]

02:22.758 --> 02:24.793
[inhales, blows]
[吸气，吹气]

02:24.862 --> 02:27.137
Science!
科学！

02:27.206 --> 02:28.137
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

02:28.206 --> 02:29.413
[militaristic music]
[军国主义音乐]

02:29.482 --> 02:33.275
Everybody on board
for lift-off.
船上所有人
用于升空。

02:33.344 --> 02:34.689
Hm.
[straining effort]
嗯。
[用力]

02:34.758 --> 02:36.172
[crashing]
- Ouch!
[崩溃]
- 哎呀！

02:36.241 --> 02:37.310
- Let's go, Scout!
- 我们走吧，斯库特！

02:37.379 --> 02:38.413
- But I'm still waiting for
- 但我还在等待

02:38.482 --> 02:42.310
the Krabby Patty delivery guy.
蟹黄派送货员

02:42.379 --> 02:43.551
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:43.620 --> 02:45.413
[ding]
- The Moon is in perfect
[叮]
- 月亮是完美的

02:45.482 --> 02:46.793
position for us to launch.
我们启动的位置。

02:46.862 --> 02:49.206
We gotta leave now.
我们现在得走了。

02:49.275 --> 02:51.482
- Whoa!
- 哇！

02:52.000 --> 02:55.517
[doorbell dinging]
[门铃响]

02:55.586 --> 02:58.655
- Hello? Delivery.
- 你好？送货。

02:58.724 --> 03:01.448
[grumbles]
[抱怨]

03:01.517 --> 03:03.931
Did someone order
a Krabby Patty?
有人下单吗
蟹肉饼？

03:06.689 --> 03:08.068
- Hm.
- 嗯。

03:08.137 --> 03:10.068
Uhh. Yuck.
呃。恶心。

03:10.137 --> 03:12.586
Hokey hoo-ha for hicks.
乡巴佬们的胡闹。

03:12.655 --> 03:14.931
[rumbling, alarm blaring]
Ahh! Ahh! Ahh! Ahh!
[隆隆声，警报声]
啊！啊！啊！啊！

03:15.000 --> 03:16.551
Ahh! I take it back!
啊！我收回来！

03:16.620 --> 03:21.724
I could learn to like songs
about tractors...maybe.
我可以学会喜欢歌曲
关于拖拉机……也许吧。

03:21.793 --> 03:22.724
- Ahh!
- 啊！

03:22.793 --> 03:24.758
all: Ahh!
全体：啊！

03:24.827 --> 03:25.586
[all sigh
[众人叹息

03:25.655 --> 03:27.068
- Uh, sorry about that.
- 呃，对此感到抱歉。

03:27.137 --> 03:28.551
Just some backfire is all.
只是一些适得其反而已。

03:28.620 --> 03:31.241
- Safety first.
- 安全第一。

03:31.310 --> 03:32.689
[straining effort]
Ah.
[用力]
啊。

03:32.758 --> 03:36.310
Uhh, ehh!
呃，呃！

03:36.379 --> 03:37.620
[popping]
Uh, why you--
[爆裂声]
呃，为什么你——

03:37.689 --> 03:39.448
[straining efforts]
[努力]

03:39.517 --> 03:43.793
- Uhh, everything okay
back there, SpongeBob?
- 呃，一切都好
海绵宝宝，在那边吗？

03:43.862 --> 03:46.172
Ahh, ay!
[groans]
啊啊啊！
[呻吟]

03:46.241 --> 03:47.379
- Huh, uh!
- 呃，呃！

03:47.448 --> 03:48.586
Ohh, ohh, ohh, ah!
哦哦哦哦啊啊！

03:48.655 --> 03:50.137
Huh!
哈！

03:50.206 --> 03:51.137
- Thanks!
- 谢谢！

03:51.206 --> 03:53.000
- Three, two, one,
- 三，二，一，

03:53.068 --> 03:55.862
launch!
发射！

03:55.931 --> 03:58.275
Whoops! Lunch.
哎呀！午餐。

03:58.344 --> 04:00.379
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

04:00.448 --> 04:02.000
- Ah!
- 啊！

04:02.068 --> 04:03.206
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

04:03.275 --> 04:04.931
[straining]
Ah!
[紧张]
啊！

04:05.000 --> 04:08.517
Ahh! Ahh!
啊！啊！

04:08.586 --> 04:10.586
- [straining]
- [紧张]

04:10.655 --> 04:13.241
[all straining]
[一切都紧张]

04:13.310 --> 04:15.137
- [laughs]
- [笑]

04:15.206 --> 04:16.206
- [straining]
- [紧张]

04:16.275 --> 04:17.655
[whimpering, struggling]
[呜咽，挣扎]

04:17.724 --> 04:20.862
[thrilling music]
[惊心动魄的音乐]

04:20.931 --> 04:21.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:21.931 --> 04:25.275
[screaming]
[尖叫]

04:25.344 --> 04:28.758
[panicked screaming]
[惊慌尖叫]

04:30.103 --> 04:32.310
Eh--did I die?
呃——我死了吗？

04:32.379 --> 04:33.896
Am I a ghost?
我是鬼吗？

04:33.965 --> 04:36.034
Ahh!
啊！

04:37.793 --> 04:41.172
- Okay, Scouts, you're free to
move about the cabin.
- 好吧，侦察兵，你们可以了
在机舱内走动。

04:41.241 --> 04:42.689
- Ooh, whoa!
- 哦，哇！

04:42.758 --> 04:45.137
I'm flying, I'm flying!
我飞了，我飞了！

04:45.206 --> 04:48.344
Whoop! [laughs]
哎哟！ [笑]

04:48.413 --> 04:49.724
[laughs]
[笑]

04:49.793 --> 04:51.103
- This peanut plant's pulse
- 这种花生植物的脉搏

04:51.172 --> 04:53.655
is staying steady in zero G.
保持稳定在零重力。

04:53.724 --> 04:56.862
- I've never been
so light before.
- 我从来没有去过
之前那么轻。

04:56.931 --> 04:58.586
[gasps] Ahh!
[喘气]啊！

04:58.655 --> 05:00.551
[zapping]
[struggling efforts]
[电击]
【奋斗努力】

05:00.620 --> 05:03.586
[sighs, chuckles softly]
[叹息，轻笑]

05:03.655 --> 05:05.655
- Uhh, I gotta fix that.
- 呃，我得解决这个问题。

05:05.724 --> 05:08.448
- Teenage Action Girl,
rise to the rescue
- 十几岁的行动女孩，
奋起救援

05:08.517 --> 05:11.896
of Action Dog
while Teenage Action Boy
行动狗
而少年行动男孩

05:11.965 --> 05:14.448
floats in the corner
and mopes.
漂浮在角落里
和闷闷不乐。

05:14.517 --> 05:15.931
[imitating]
I don't care.
[模仿]
我不在乎。

05:16.000 --> 05:18.241
Oh, no. Help me.
哦，不。帮我。

05:18.310 --> 05:19.620
- Uhh!
- Hey!
- 呃！
- 嘿！

05:19.689 --> 05:21.379
Watch it, you big orca!
小心点，你这个大逆戟鲸！

05:21.448 --> 05:24.620
- You watch it,
you big dorka.
- 你看，
你这个大朵卡。

05:24.689 --> 05:26.724
- [blows raspberry]
- [吹覆盆子]

05:26.793 --> 05:30.137
[twangy country music playing]
[演奏着浓烈的乡村音乐]

05:30.206 --> 05:35.758
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:35.827 --> 05:38.448
- There can be only
one explanation.
- 只能有
一个解释。

05:38.517 --> 05:41.517
I've lost my mind.
我失去了理智。

05:41.586 --> 05:43.793
All those years working
at the Krusty Krab
工作这么多年
在蟹堡王

05:43.862 --> 05:45.931
and I finally snapped.
我终于崩溃了。

05:46.000 --> 05:49.827
Ohh, going crazy
is actually a relief.
哦哦，要疯了
其实是一种解脱。

05:49.896 --> 05:53.724
[sighs]
All my stress is gone.
[叹气]
我所有的压力都消失了。

05:53.793 --> 05:55.965
Ahh!
[rumbling]
啊！
[隆隆声]

05:56.034 --> 05:59.724
Ahh! Ahh!
All my stress is back!
啊！啊！
我所有的压力都回来了！

05:59.793 --> 06:02.241
- Uh, oh,
we've got space junk!
- 呃，哦，
我们有太空垃圾！

06:02.310 --> 06:03.862
Everybody, back in your seats.
各位，回到座位上。

06:03.931 --> 06:05.517
Trays in upright position.
托盘处于直立位置。

06:05.586 --> 06:06.620
Head between your knees.
头放在膝盖之间。

06:06.689 --> 06:08.413
Your mama can't save you now!
你妈妈现在救不了你了！

06:08.482 --> 06:13.172
- Ohh!
[struggling efforts]
- 哦！
【奋斗努力】

06:13.241 --> 06:15.655
[alarm blaring]
[警报声]

06:15.724 --> 06:17.896
- Ahh!
[stadium organ music]
- 啊！
[体育场管风琴音乐]

06:17.965 --> 06:20.413
[all cheering]
- Home run!
[大家欢呼]
- 全垒打！

06:20.482 --> 06:21.655
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

06:21.724 --> 06:23.206
- [grunting] Eee!
- [咕哝] 哎呀！

06:23.275 --> 06:26.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:26.275 --> 06:28.413
We've still got a few
Astro Belts to get through.
我们还有一些
Astro 腰带可以通过。

06:28.482 --> 06:30.827
Brace yourselves
for the Cold Belt.
做好准备
为寒带。

06:30.896 --> 06:34.034
[wind blowing]
[sleigh bells jangling]
[风吹来]
[雪橇铃叮当作响]

06:34.103 --> 06:36.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:36.275 --> 06:38.275
[teeth chattering]
[牙齿打战]

06:41.275 --> 06:44.448
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

06:44.517 --> 06:46.275
[laughs]
[笑]

06:46.344 --> 06:48.931
[both shivering]
[两人都在发抖]

06:49.000 --> 06:51.413
- Next up,
we got a hot belt.
- 接下来，
我们有一条热腰带。

06:51.482 --> 06:54.413
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

06:54.482 --> 07:00.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:00.275 --> 07:02.344
[ding]
[叮]

07:03.551 --> 07:05.586
- Ohh!
- 哦！

07:05.655 --> 07:07.689
[chuckles] Patty melt.
[笑]帕蒂融化了。

07:07.758 --> 07:11.000
- [breathing heavily]
- [呼吸粗重]

07:12.689 --> 07:13.931
[sizzling]
Ow!
[嘶嘶声]
噢！

07:14.000 --> 07:17.000
[blowing]
[吹]

07:17.068 --> 07:20.344
Huh! We're going through
the radiation belt!
哈！ We're going through
the radiation belt!

07:20.413 --> 07:23.275
That could cause mutations.
这可能会导致突变。

07:23.344 --> 07:26.241
Everybody, get under
your lead blankets!
大家都下来吧
你的铅毯子！

07:26.310 --> 07:27.862
- [gasps] Mutations?
- [喘气] 突变？

07:27.931 --> 07:30.827
I must protect
my beautiful face!
我必须保护
我美丽的脸！

07:32.827 --> 07:34.965
- Hmm. [grunts]
- 唔。 [咕哝]

07:35.034 --> 07:37.103
[impact landing]
[birds chirping]
[撞击着陆]
[鸟鸣声]

07:37.172 --> 07:39.689
[eerie wobbling]
[诡异的摇晃]

07:41.620 --> 07:43.586
- Hmm?
- 唔？

07:43.655 --> 07:44.724
Hm.
嗯。

07:44.793 --> 07:47.241
Mm? [laughs]
毫米？ [笑]

07:47.310 --> 07:49.241
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

07:49.310 --> 07:50.379
- Aww. [chuckles]
- 哇。 [笑声]

07:50.448 --> 07:53.482
- Ahh, ohh, ahh!
- 啊啊啊啊啊！

07:53.551 --> 07:55.000
Oh, good Neptune.
噢，好海王星。

07:55.068 --> 07:57.034
I'm going through
puberty again.
我正在经历
再次进入青春期。

07:57.103 --> 08:00.379
Yah, uhh, ohh!
[giggling]
啊啊啊啊！
[咯咯笑]

08:02.172 --> 08:05.655
- Okay, Scouts,
it's all safe now.
- 好吧，侦察兵，
现在一切都安全了。

08:05.724 --> 08:07.689
Let's see where we are.
让我们看看我们在哪里。

08:07.758 --> 08:10.586
Craters, craters--
陨石坑，陨石坑——

08:10.655 --> 08:12.310
- [screaming]
- Oh! Giant eyeball?
- [尖叫]
- 哦！巨大的眼球？

08:12.379 --> 08:15.034
Now I'm as confused
as a goat on Astroturf.
现在我很困惑
作为 Astroturf 上的山羊。

08:15.103 --> 08:17.413
- [giggling]
- Ohh! SpongeBob!
- [咯咯笑]
- 哦！海绵宝宝！

08:17.482 --> 08:20.275
- Hey, there's a tiny,
little squirrel in here.
- 嘿，有一个小，
小松鼠在这里。

08:20.344 --> 08:21.586
- [chittering]
- How'd you get in there,
- [叽叽喳喳]
- 你怎么进去的

08:21.655 --> 08:23.206
you little fuzz ball?
你这个小毛球吗？

08:23.275 --> 08:25.655
- I love the guy, but if his
brains were dynamite,
- 我爱这个人，但如果他
大脑是炸药，

08:25.724 --> 08:27.482
he couldn't blow his nose.
他无法擤鼻涕。

08:27.551 --> 08:30.034
- Ahh!
- 啊！

08:34.482 --> 08:36.517
Ha, we've stopped.
哈，我们停下来了。

08:36.586 --> 08:39.620
It's all over!
I'm back home!
一切都结束了！
我回来了！

08:39.689 --> 08:43.758
[laughs]
[humming]
[笑]
[嗡嗡声]

08:43.827 --> 08:45.206
Wait a minute.
等一下。

08:45.275 --> 08:46.896
That's the Earth.
那就是地球。

08:46.965 --> 08:50.827
And that down there is
the Moon?
那下面有
月亮？

08:50.896 --> 08:55.068
So somehow the tree dome
flew here.
所以不知怎的，树圆顶
飞到这里了。

08:55.137 --> 08:57.448
Good Neptune, I'm falling!
好海王星，我要坠落了！

08:57.517 --> 09:00.172
Wait, if I remember
my high school science,
等等，如果我记得的话
我的高中科学，

09:00.241 --> 09:03.758
on the Moon, I'm much lighter
than on Earth.
在月球上，我轻多了
比在地球上。

09:03.827 --> 09:04.896
Which means...
这意味着...

09:04.965 --> 09:08.793
ha, this fall won't hurt me.
哈，这个秋天不会伤害我。

09:08.862 --> 09:15.448
[crunching]
[pained groaning]
[嘎吱嘎吱]
[痛苦的呻吟]

09:15.517 --> 09:18.482
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

09:21.586 --> 09:22.931
[screams]
[尖叫声]

09:23.000 --> 09:26.724
[thrilling music]
[惊心动魄的音乐]

09:28.137 --> 09:30.379
[moaning]
[呻吟]

09:31.413 --> 09:33.827
[blubbering]
Oh, shrimp.
[哭泣]
哦，虾。

09:33.896 --> 09:36.068
Now where am I?
现在我在哪里？

09:36.137 --> 09:38.689
Maybe this is the way out.
也许这就是出路。

09:38.758 --> 09:41.000
[twangy guitar music]
[鼻音吉他音乐]

09:41.068 --> 09:42.827
- [screeches]
- [screams]
- [尖叫声]
- [尖叫]

09:42.896 --> 09:46.758
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:46.827 --> 09:48.137
Maybe this one?
也许是这个？

09:48.206 --> 09:50.068
[twangy country music]
[浓烈的乡村音乐]

09:50.137 --> 09:53.137
- Are y'all ready to go nuts
for some hokey hoo ha?
- 你们准备好发疯了吗
为了一些做作的胡哈？

09:53.206 --> 09:55.724
[crowd cheering]
[人群欢呼]

09:55.793 --> 09:58.000
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

10:00.724 --> 10:02.620
Third time's a charm.
第三次是一个魅力。

10:02.689 --> 10:03.724
[straining effort]
Hm.
[用力]
嗯。

10:03.793 --> 10:04.896
[screams]
[尖叫声]

10:04.965 --> 10:06.482
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

10:06.551 --> 10:08.793
- Ahh!
- 啊！

10:10.758 --> 10:13.655
[heroic music]
[英雄音乐]

10:13.724 --> 10:17.275
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:17.344 --> 10:20.137
- One small step
for a squirrel...
- 一小步
对于一只松鼠...

10:20.206 --> 10:21.896
- Ooh!
- 哦！

10:21.965 --> 10:23.413
[screams]
[struggling efforts]
[尖叫声]
【奋斗努力】

10:23.482 --> 10:25.344
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

10:25.413 --> 10:26.586
[all grunt, moan]
[全是咕哝声、呻吟声]

10:26.655 --> 10:29.413
- One giant heap
for SpongeKind.
- 一大堆
对于海绵类。

10:29.482 --> 10:30.655
[laughs]
[笑]

10:30.724 --> 10:32.862
[all scream]
[所有人尖叫]

10:32.931 --> 10:34.896
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

10:34.965 --> 10:36.551
- All right, Science Scouts,
- 好吧，科学童子军，

10:36.620 --> 10:38.034
everybody's got an assignment.
每个人都有一个任务。

10:38.103 --> 10:40.068
Pearl, you measure
the Moon's gravity.
珍珠，你量一下
月球的引力。

10:40.137 --> 10:45.000
- Rah, rah, sis, Moon,
bahhh!
- 啊，啊，姐姐，月亮，
呸！

10:46.103 --> 10:47.965
- Squidina, you collect
Moon rocks.
- Squidina，你收集
月亮岩石。

10:48.034 --> 10:49.931
[machine chirping]
- Way ahead of you,
[机器鸣叫]
- 远远领先于你，

10:50.000 --> 10:52.482
Ms. Scout Ma'am Cheeks.
斯库特女士，奇克斯女士。

10:52.551 --> 10:54.206
Hmm.
唔。

10:54.275 --> 10:56.137
- Grrr-avity!
- 哎呀——热闹！

10:56.206 --> 10:57.000
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

10:57.068 --> 10:58.655
- SpongeBob, you can search
- 海绵宝宝，你可以搜索

10:58.724 --> 11:00.586
for intelligent life.
- Aye, aye.
为了智能生活。
- 是的，是的。

11:00.655 --> 11:03.034
Hmm...mmm...
嗯……嗯……

11:03.103 --> 11:06.034
- You do know how to recognize
intelligent life, right?
- 你确实知道如何识别
智能生活对吧？

11:06.103 --> 11:08.310
- Oh, sure.
I cut open their heads
- 哦，当然。
我切开他们的头

11:08.379 --> 11:10.310
to see if they have
any brains.
看看他们是否有
任何大脑。

11:10.379 --> 11:11.310
- Mm. [sighs]
- 毫米。 [叹气]

11:11.379 --> 11:13.586
If you find anything,
just toot.
如果你发现什么，
只是嘟嘟地。

11:13.655 --> 11:14.620
- Ooh!
[toots horn]
- 哦！
[嘟嘟喇叭]

11:14.689 --> 11:16.482
[laughs]
[horn honking]
[笑]
[喇叭鸣响]

11:16.551 --> 11:19.241
- Now to study the Moon's
gravitational effects
- 现在研究月球
引力效应

11:19.310 --> 11:23.551
on my nuts.
我的疯子。

11:23.620 --> 11:25.034
- [chuckles softly]
- [轻笑]

11:25.103 --> 11:28.103
- I'm number one!
You're number two!
- 我是第一！
你是第二名！

11:28.172 --> 11:31.620
I'm gonna beat
the nerd out of you!
我要打败
你真是个书呆子！

11:31.689 --> 11:34.724
- [huffs] No one
beats the nerd
- [怒气冲冲] 没有人
击败书呆子

11:34.793 --> 11:36.689
out of Squidina!
从斯奎迪纳出来！

11:36.758 --> 11:39.551
Ahh!
- Whoa!
啊！
- 哇！

11:39.620 --> 11:40.827
Missed me!
想我了！

11:40.896 --> 11:43.103
[laughs]
[blows raspberry]
[笑]
[吹覆盆子]

11:46.275 --> 11:49.344
Ohh!
- Science! Yay!
哦！
- 科学！耶！

11:51.655 --> 11:54.310
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

11:54.379 --> 11:57.344
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

11:57.413 --> 12:01.655
Well, maybe being
on the Moon isn't so bad.
好吧，也许是
月球上的情况并没有那么糟糕。

12:01.724 --> 12:07.275
After all, SpongeBob
is over 238,000 miles away.
毕竟海绵宝宝
距离超过 238,000 英里。

12:07.344 --> 12:09.655
Huh!
哈！

12:09.724 --> 12:11.103
[snap]
- Ow!
[啪]
- 噢！

12:11.172 --> 12:15.965
- [gasps] This Moon
is a no SpongeBob zone!
- [喘气]这个月亮
是一个没有海绵宝宝的区域！

12:16.034 --> 12:19.000
Here, I'm the man
在这里，我就是那个男人

12:19.068 --> 12:22.137
on the Moon! [echoing]
在月球上！ [回声]

12:24.103 --> 12:29.379
- Um, did someone say
man on the Moon?
- 嗯，有人说吗
月球上的人？

12:29.448 --> 12:30.724
Hello?
你好？

12:30.793 --> 12:32.793
Intelligent life?
智能生活？

12:32.862 --> 12:35.862
How about average smarts?
平均智力怎么样？

12:35.931 --> 12:38.379
I'd settle for common sense!
我会满足于常识！

12:38.448 --> 12:39.482
[sighs]
[叹气]

12:39.551 --> 12:41.793
Ooh!
Intelligent footprints.
哦！
智能足迹。

12:41.862 --> 12:44.655
[epic classical music]
【史诗般的古典音乐】

12:44.724 --> 12:47.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:47.310 --> 12:50.689
[gasps]
[ding]
[喘气]
[叮]

12:50.758 --> 12:52.724
[honk]
Huh?
[鸣喇叭]
啊？

12:52.793 --> 12:55.172
[honking]
Wha-hoo!
[鸣喇叭]
哇呼！

12:55.241 --> 12:57.137
I found it! I found it!
我找到了！我找到了！

12:57.206 --> 12:59.724
- [panting]
What'd you find, SpaceBob?
- [气喘吁吁]
你发现了什么，太空鲍勃？

12:59.793 --> 13:02.862
- Intelligent life.
[honking]
- 智慧生活。
[鸣喇叭]

13:02.931 --> 13:05.000
- I'm not so sure about that.
- 我对此不太确定。

13:05.068 --> 13:06.482
If they were intelligent,
they would have
如果他们聪明的话
他们会有

13:06.551 --> 13:08.275
eaten this Krabby Patty.
- Ooh.
吃了这个蟹肉饼。
- 哦。

13:08.344 --> 13:11.000
Mmm, speaking of eating.
[stomach rumbles]
嗯，说到吃。
[肚子咕咕叫]

13:11.068 --> 13:13.275
- You're right!
It's lunch time.
- 你说得对！
午餐时间到了。

13:13.344 --> 13:15.448
Would you mind fetching
the lunch I prepared?
你介意拿来吗
我准备的午餐？

13:15.517 --> 13:18.068
- You bet!
Just call me LunchBob.
- 你打赌！
就叫我午餐鲍勃吧。

13:18.137 --> 13:21.241
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

13:21.310 --> 13:23.758
- Just press the button
labeled "lunch".
- 只需按下按钮
标记为“午餐”。

13:23.827 --> 13:25.586
- No SpongeBob, no SpongeBob,
- 没有海绵宝宝，没有海绵宝宝，

13:25.655 --> 13:27.965
no SpongeBob,
SpongeBob, SpongeBob.
没有海绵宝宝，
海绵宝宝，海绵宝宝。

13:28.034 --> 13:30.517
No SpongeBob, no Sp--
没有海绵宝宝，没有 Sp——

13:30.586 --> 13:31.758
Whoa!
哇！

13:31.827 --> 13:34.758
The dark side of the Moon.
月球的黑暗面。

13:34.827 --> 13:36.931
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

13:37.000 --> 13:38.172
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

13:38.241 --> 13:40.275
Are you in here?
你在这儿吗？

13:40.344 --> 13:42.758
No SpongeBob.
[blubbers]
没有海绵宝宝。
[哭声]

13:42.827 --> 13:46.827
I've a strange feeling
suddenly coming over me.
我有一种奇怪的感觉
突然向我袭来。

13:46.896 --> 13:48.172
Could it be...
难道是……

13:48.241 --> 13:51.655
that I'm...happy?
我很……高兴？

13:55.137 --> 13:57.103
- Lunch, lunch,
where's lunch?
- 午餐，午餐，
午餐在哪里？

13:57.172 --> 13:58.482
Oh, there it is.
[buzzing]
哦，就在那里。
[嗡嗡声]

13:58.551 --> 14:01.241
[whimpers]
- Preparing to launch.
[呜咽]
- 准备发射。

14:01.310 --> 14:03.310
- No! No, not launch!
- 不！不，不启动！

14:03.379 --> 14:06.724
Lunch!
[whimpering]
午餐！
[呜咽]

14:06.793 --> 14:14.068
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

14:17.413 --> 14:20.413
- Uh, wait, wait--
what's going on?
- 呃，等等，等等——
发生什么事了？

14:20.482 --> 14:23.034
[whimpering]
- How should I know?
[呜咽]
- 我怎么知道？

14:23.103 --> 14:25.344
Ahh, ahh.
- You guys wait here.
啊啊啊。
- 你们在这里等一下。

14:25.413 --> 14:27.206
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

14:27.275 --> 14:31.103
[grunts] Yah!
[咕哝] 啊！

14:31.172 --> 14:32.689
[alarm blaring]
[警报声]

14:32.758 --> 14:34.862
[alarm stops]
[警报停止]

14:34.931 --> 14:38.137
[farts]
[放屁]

14:38.206 --> 14:40.517
Phew. SpongeBob?
唷。海绵宝宝？

14:40.586 --> 14:43.310
- Eh, eh, eh.
- SpongeBob!
- 呃，呃，呃。
- 海绵宝宝！

14:43.379 --> 14:46.413
- Oh, uh, Sandy.
[chuckles] Hey, girl.
- 哦，呃，桑迪。
[笑]嘿，女孩。

14:46.482 --> 14:48.172
I was just gonna
run back home.
我正要
跑回家。

14:48.241 --> 14:49.896
I forgot, uh...
我忘了，呃...

14:49.965 --> 14:50.896
my reading glasses.
我的老花镜。

14:50.965 --> 14:52.896
[sighs]
[panting]
[叹气]
[气喘吁吁]

14:52.965 --> 14:56.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

14:56.068 --> 14:58.275
Yow!
哟！

14:59.620 --> 15:01.379
- It's okay, SpongeBob.
It's my fault
- 没关系，海绵宝宝。
是我的错

15:01.448 --> 15:03.931
for putting the launch and
lunch button so close together.
用于发射和
午餐按钮靠得很近。

15:04.000 --> 15:07.275
Oh, no! The Moon's been pulled
out of its regular orbit.
哦，不！月亮被拉了
脱离其正常轨道。

15:07.344 --> 15:08.344
That could have disastrous
这可能会带来灾难性的后果

15:08.413 --> 15:10.000
effects on
the Earth's tides.
影响于
地球的潮汐。

15:10.068 --> 15:13.310
[water drains gurgling]
[流水潺潺]

15:13.379 --> 15:15.206
- Water's a little dry today.
- 今天水有点干。

15:15.275 --> 15:16.344
[boat motor humming]
[tires screech]
[船马达嗡嗡声]
[轮胎尖叫声]

15:16.413 --> 15:17.862
[both gasping]
[两人都喘气]

15:17.931 --> 15:20.241
- And that last launch
depleted our fuel.
- 最后一次发射
耗尽了我们的燃料。

15:20.310 --> 15:22.000
- Ho ho ho.
[sleigh bells jangling]
- 嗬嗬嗬。
[雪橇铃叮当作响]

15:22.068 --> 15:23.448
- That's weird.
- 这很奇怪。

15:23.517 --> 15:27.344
- [panting] I'm so sorry
you're a cheerleader.
- [气喘吁吁]我很抱歉
你是啦啦队长。

15:27.413 --> 15:30.310
- I'm sorry you're a nerd.
- 对不起，你是个书呆子。

15:30.379 --> 15:34.310
both: That came out wrong.
[crying]
两者：结果是错误的。
[哭泣]

15:34.379 --> 15:35.931
- Ooh, Moon hugs!
- 哦，月亮拥抱！

15:36.000 --> 15:37.241
Make room for me.
给我腾出空间。

15:37.310 --> 15:39.344
Come on, Sandy,
bring it on in.
来吧，桑迪，
把它带进来。

15:39.413 --> 15:41.586
- It's all right, Scouts.
- 没关系，侦察兵。

15:41.655 --> 15:43.655
We just gotta figure out
a way to get back to Earth.
我们只需要弄清楚
返回地球的方法。

15:43.724 --> 15:47.965
- But Sandy, we heard strange
laughing coming from...
- 但是桑迪，我们听到奇怪的声音
笑声来自...

15:48.034 --> 15:49.689
in there.
在那里。

15:49.758 --> 15:51.206
- Ho ho ho.
- 嗬嗬嗬。

15:51.275 --> 15:53.551
[all gasping]
- Huh? Squidward?
[全都喘气]
- 啊？章鱼哥？

15:53.620 --> 15:55.724
You're the man on the Moon?
你是月球上的那个人吗？

15:55.793 --> 15:57.482
- SpongeBob?!
- 海绵宝宝？！

15:57.551 --> 15:59.931
[sighs] Of course.
Why not?
[叹气]当然。
为什么不呢？

16:00.000 --> 16:02.620
[sleigh bells jangling]
[雪橇铃叮当作响]

16:02.689 --> 16:04.034
Ohh!
哦！

16:04.103 --> 16:10.344
Oh! Oh! Oh!
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!
哦！哦！哦！
噢！噢！噢！噢！

16:10.413 --> 16:13.310
- SpongeBob? Ho ho,
I should've known
- 海绵宝宝？嗬嗬，
我早该知道

16:13.379 --> 16:15.758
you'd have
something to do with this.
你会有
与此有关的事情。

16:15.827 --> 16:17.448
- Santy Claus!
- 圣诞老人！

16:17.517 --> 16:19.034
Well, Santa, you know
the saying,
嗯，圣诞老人，你知道的
俗话说，

16:19.103 --> 16:23.310
where SpongeBob goes...
- I know, trouble follows.
海绵宝宝去哪里...
- 我知道，麻烦随之而来。

16:23.379 --> 16:26.034
- I was gonna say
laughter follows. [laughs]
-我本来想说
笑声随之而来。 [笑]

16:26.103 --> 16:28.551
- Mr. Claus, what are you doing
on the dark side?
- 克劳斯先生，你在做什么
在黑暗的一面？

16:28.620 --> 16:31.103
- The dark side of the Moon
is the only place
- 月球的黑暗面
是唯一的地方

16:31.172 --> 16:33.896
dark enough
for me to get any sleep.
足够黑
让我能睡个好觉。

16:33.965 --> 16:36.379
I was sleeping like a baby--
我睡得像个婴儿——

16:36.448 --> 16:38.689
visions of sugarplums.
糖李子的愿景。

16:38.758 --> 16:41.931
Then this bad boy goes
and bangs into my sleigh
然后这个坏男孩就走了
撞到我的雪橇上

16:42.000 --> 16:43.655
and wakes me up!
并叫醒我！

16:43.724 --> 16:47.172
- Well, I guess I'm getting
nothing for Christmas...
- 好吧，我想我得到了
圣诞节没什么事...

16:47.241 --> 16:48.896
again.
再次。

16:48.965 --> 16:50.172
- [blubbering]
- [哭泣]

16:50.241 --> 16:52.137
Holy night, SpongeBob!
圣夜，海绵宝宝！

16:52.206 --> 16:53.896
Did you shrink the Earth?
你把地球缩小了吗？

16:53.965 --> 16:56.413
- [stammering]
Good question, Mr. Claus.
- [结巴]
好问题，克劳斯先生。

16:56.482 --> 16:58.586
- We're actually further
from the Earth now.
- 我们实际上更进一步
现在从地球上。

16:58.655 --> 17:01.344
We could have moved the Moon
back into its regular orbit
我们本可以移动月球
回到正常轨道

17:01.413 --> 17:03.586
if we hadn't run out of fuel.
如果我们没有耗尽燃料的话。

17:03.655 --> 17:05.448
- [whistles]
- [口哨]

17:05.517 --> 17:08.310
- A controlled explosion
might move the Moon back.
- 受控爆炸
可能会把月球移回来。

17:08.379 --> 17:10.310
[pop]
- Ha, you're so smart.
[流行音乐]
- 哈，你真聪明。

17:10.379 --> 17:13.379
How do we do that?
- Hmm.
我们该怎么做呢？
- 唔。

17:13.448 --> 17:14.793
[straining efforts]
[努力]

17:14.862 --> 17:17.137
Ohh, ohh, ohh!
哦哦哦哦！

17:17.206 --> 17:18.275
[ding]
Ahh.
[叮]
啊。

17:18.344 --> 17:19.275
Ooh!
[belching]
哦！
[打嗝]

17:19.344 --> 17:20.758
Fizz Bomb Cola!
嘶嘶炸弹可乐！

17:20.827 --> 17:25.241
A burp explosion in every can.
[belching]
每个罐头都会打嗝爆炸。
[打嗝]

17:25.310 --> 17:26.517
[farting]
[放屁]

17:26.586 --> 17:30.793
- Yee-haw!
That's my Science Scouts!
- 哎呀！
这就是我的科学侦察兵！

17:30.862 --> 17:32.758
[all glugging]
[全都吞吞吐吐]

17:32.827 --> 17:35.655
[slurping]
[发出声音]

17:35.724 --> 17:38.275
[moaning]
[呻吟]

17:38.344 --> 17:41.206
[belches]
[打嗝]

17:41.275 --> 17:44.448
[all belching]
[全都打嗝]

17:44.517 --> 17:48.931
[explosion booms]
[爆炸声]

17:49.000 --> 17:50.275
- [laughs]
- [笑]

17:50.344 --> 17:53.275
[beeping]
- No go, the Moon's to heavy.
[嘟嘟声]
- 不行，月亮太重了。

17:53.344 --> 17:56.206
[belches]
- [laughs]
[打嗝]
- [笑]

17:56.275 --> 17:57.965
I think some children
might be needing
我认为有些孩子
可能需要

17:58.034 --> 18:01.103
some brains for Christmas.
[chuckles]
圣诞节的一些大脑。
[笑声]

18:01.172 --> 18:02.827
[straining efforts]
[努力]

18:02.896 --> 18:05.172
[heroic music]
[英雄音乐]

18:05.241 --> 18:06.551
- Perfection!
- 完美！

18:06.620 --> 18:08.344
- Now we just wait
for a gust of wind.
- 现在我们只需等待
为了一阵风。

18:08.413 --> 18:11.620
[crickets chirping]
[蟋蟀鸣叫]

18:12.724 --> 18:14.655
- Uh, interesting
science fact:
- 呃，有趣
科学事实：

18:14.724 --> 18:16.655
there's no atmosphere
on the Moon,
没有气氛
在月球上，

18:16.724 --> 18:18.310
therefore there's no wind.
所以没有风。

18:18.379 --> 18:23.344
- [laughing]
- [笑]

18:23.413 --> 18:26.379
- Why don't we just
push the Moon back?
- 我们为什么不直接
把月球推回去？

18:29.413 --> 18:31.413
Ahh! Hm, hmm.
啊！嗯，嗯。

18:31.482 --> 18:33.482
[straining efforts]
[努力]

18:33.551 --> 18:35.896
[speaking gibberish]
[胡言乱语]

18:35.965 --> 18:37.827
[all straining]
[一切都紧张]

18:37.896 --> 18:40.862
- [laughs] You all should be
a sea monster
- [笑]你们都应该是
一个海怪

18:40.931 --> 18:43.379
because you're Kraken me up.
[rim shot]
因为你是海妖，让我振作起来。
[边缘射击]

18:43.448 --> 18:46.448
Get it? Kraken?
[laughs]
得到它？海妖？
[笑]

18:46.517 --> 18:50.241
- Santa Claus, you can do more
than just say ho ho ho at us.
- 圣诞老人，你可以做更多
而不是只是对我们说“嗬嗬嗬”。

18:50.310 --> 18:52.000
You can dig into
that toy sack of yours
你可以深入研究
你的那个玩具袋

18:52.068 --> 18:53.413
and find something to help.
并找到一些可以帮助的东西。

18:53.482 --> 18:56.448
- But I'm having
such a jolly, holly time!
- 但我有
多么快乐、多么美好的时光啊！

18:56.517 --> 18:58.620
- [grumbles]
- You're right.
- [抱怨]
- 你是对的。

18:58.689 --> 19:01.517
I'm being naughty, not nice.
我很顽皮，一点也不友善。

19:02.413 --> 19:04.103
[thrilling music]
[惊心动魄的音乐]

19:04.172 --> 19:06.517
- Hm, mm.
- Ah.
- 嗯，嗯。
- 啊。

19:06.586 --> 19:09.344
- Huh?
- Everyone nestled all snug?
- 啊？
- 每个人都舒适地依偎着吗？

19:09.413 --> 19:10.793
- We're all snug, Santa.
- 我们都很舒服，圣诞老人。

19:10.862 --> 19:12.517
But why is SpongeBob with you?
但为什么海绵宝宝会和你在一起呢？

19:12.586 --> 19:14.482
- Yeah, why am I riding
with you?
- 是啊，我为什么要骑车
和你在一起吗？

19:14.551 --> 19:16.103
Not that it isn't a pleasure.
并不是说这不是一种乐趣。

19:16.172 --> 19:20.448
- I want you close to me
so I can keep an eye on you.
- 我想要你靠近我
这样我就可以关注你了。

19:20.517 --> 19:22.827
You're a menace!
你是一个威胁！

19:22.896 --> 19:25.689
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

19:25.758 --> 19:28.000
- Yah!
- Ohh!
- 啊！
- 哦！

19:30.206 --> 19:33.827
First, I'll push Sandy's rocket
ship out of harm's way.
首先，我会推动桑迪的火箭
船舶远离危险。

19:33.896 --> 19:38.068
SpongeBob, hand me
that jack-in-the-box.
海绵宝宝，把我递过来
那个玩偶盒子。

19:38.137 --> 19:39.344
- Jack-in-the-box.
- 杰克盒子。

19:39.413 --> 19:41.517
- [panting]
[cranking, tune playing]
- [气喘吁吁]
[曲柄、曲调演奏]

19:41.586 --> 19:47.275
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

19:47.344 --> 19:48.931
- Oh, oh! Let me try!
- 哦，哦！让我试试！

19:49.000 --> 19:50.172
[cranking, tune playing]
- Be careful!
[曲柄、曲调演奏]
- 小心！

19:50.241 --> 19:51.689
Don't overwind it!
不要过度缠绕它！

19:51.758 --> 19:53.344
- But it's gotta be strong
enough to move the Moon.
- 但一定要坚强
足以移动月球。

19:53.413 --> 19:56.206
[vocalizing]
[发声]

19:56.275 --> 19:58.034
[clang]
[rattling]
[叮当声]
[嘎嘎声]

19:58.103 --> 20:00.896
- You broke it,
and it was my last one.
- 你弄坏了它，
这是我的最后一次。

20:00.965 --> 20:04.310
- Hmm. Oh, wait.
I think I can hear
- 唔。哦，等等。
我想我能听到

20:04.379 --> 20:06.103
the last note
struggling to get out.
最后一个音符
挣扎着想出去。

20:06.172 --> 20:08.241
Come on, Jack, you can do it.
来吧，杰克，你能做到的。

20:08.310 --> 20:10.344
I believe in you!
我相信你！

20:10.413 --> 20:12.310
- Ho ho ho ho!
- 嗬嗬嗬！

20:12.379 --> 20:17.689
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

20:19.103 --> 20:21.103
- What happened?
- 发生了什么？

20:21.172 --> 20:23.172
- [grumbles]
- Oh.
- [抱怨]
- 哦。

20:23.241 --> 20:25.344
Okay, sorry.
It was my bad.
好吧，抱歉。
这是我的错。

20:25.413 --> 20:28.344
[eerie music]
[诡异的音乐]

20:28.413 --> 20:30.827
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

20:30.896 --> 20:32.793
[water gurgling]
[流水潺潺]

20:32.862 --> 20:36.000
- Oh, excuse me.
Sorry. [chuckles]
- 哦，对不起。
对不起。 [笑声]

20:36.068 --> 20:38.068
[sizzling]
Ahh!
[嘶嘶声]
啊！

20:40.172 --> 20:43.275
- Oh oh oh.
- 哦哦哦。

20:43.344 --> 20:44.965
- Oh oh oh?
- 哦哦哦？

20:45.034 --> 20:47.413
- Ho ho ho backwards.
- 嗬嗬嗬向后退。

20:47.482 --> 20:49.724
- Ah!
[shimmering tone]
- 啊！
[闪烁的音调]

20:49.793 --> 20:52.724
Santa, do you have any
water shooters in your bag?
圣诞老人，你有吗
你的包里有水枪吗？

20:52.793 --> 20:55.482
- Yes, the whole sack
is full of 'em.
- 是的，整个麻袋
充满了他们。

20:55.551 --> 20:57.310
[thrilling music]
[惊心动魄的音乐]

20:57.379 --> 20:59.655
- Mm, mm!
- 嗯，嗯！

20:59.724 --> 21:02.379
Mm.
毫米。

21:02.448 --> 21:04.517
All right, Santa,
squirt me.
好吧，圣诞老人，
喷我。

21:04.586 --> 21:06.896
- Oh, I get it.
- 哦，我明白了。

21:06.965 --> 21:08.448
Uh!
呃！

21:08.517 --> 21:10.517
- Whoo! Keep 'em coming, Santa!
- 呼！让他们来吧，圣诞老人！

21:10.586 --> 21:14.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

21:14.758 --> 21:16.551
[seagull chirping]
[海鸥鸣叫]

21:16.620 --> 21:20.103
[water glugging]
[吸水]

21:20.172 --> 21:27.172
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

21:31.689 --> 21:33.413
- Using the leftover
Fizz Bomb Cola
- 使用剩余的
汽水炸弹可乐

21:33.482 --> 21:36.724
made an excellent rocket fuel,
Science Scout Squidina.
制造了优良的火箭燃料，
科学侦察员鱿鱼。

21:36.793 --> 21:40.379
- Yep, the rocket
burped us back. [laughs]
- 是的，火箭
让我们打嗝了。 [笑]

21:40.448 --> 21:41.965
- [straining effort] Yah!
- [用力] 啊！

21:42.034 --> 21:46.344
Wow, would you mind teaching me
some nerdy science stuff?
哇，你介意教我吗
一些书呆子科学的东西？

21:46.413 --> 21:51.310
- Sure, if you'll teach me
some airhead cheerleader stuff.
- 当然可以，如果你愿意教我的话
一些空头啦啦队长的东西。

21:51.379 --> 21:53.068
[both laughing]
[rumbling]
[两人都笑了]
[隆隆声]

21:53.137 --> 21:55.586
- Ahh! Ahh! Ahh!
- Oh! Ah! Whoa! Hey!
- 啊！啊！啊！
- 哦！啊!哇！嘿！

21:55.655 --> 21:58.000
- Why don't you join
the Science Scouts, Squidward?
- 你为什么不加入
科学侦察兵，章鱼哥？

21:58.068 --> 22:03.241
- No thanks. Science is crazy
and filled with lunatics.
- 不，谢谢。科学是疯狂的
并充满了疯子。

22:03.310 --> 22:06.758
- Speaking of luna, I wonder
how old SpongeBob doing.
- 说到露娜，我想知道
海绵宝宝多大了？

22:06.827 --> 22:09.965
[Christmasy music]
[圣诞音乐]

22:10.034 --> 22:13.068
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

22:13.137 --> 22:14.482
- Good night, Earth.
- 晚安，地球。

22:14.551 --> 22:17.344
Hey, I'm mooning you.
[laughs]
嘿，我在偷看你。
[笑]

22:17.413 --> 22:20.551
Hello, lady. You sure look
lovely by moonlight.
你好，女士。你肯定看
月光下的可爱。

22:20.620 --> 22:21.620
- Aww!
- Hey, mister!
- 哇！
- 嘿，先生！

22:21.689 --> 22:23.137
I can see your bald spot.
我可以看到你的秃顶。

22:23.206 --> 22:24.206
- Hey!
- [laughs]
- 嘿！
- [笑]

22:24.275 --> 22:25.517
Don't be alarmed, people.
别惊慌，人们。

22:25.586 --> 22:27.103
I'm only here till December,
我只在这里呆到十二月

22:27.172 --> 22:29.965
when Santa brings everybody
a new moon for Christmas.
当圣诞老人带着大家
圣诞节的新月。

22:30.034 --> 22:31.965
[horns honking]
[people groaning]
[喇叭鸣响]
[人们呻吟]

22:32.034 --> 22:34.689
- Come on!
- Oh, sorry.
- 快点！
- 哦，抱歉。

22:34.758 --> 22:36.758
Just gave away the big
surprise, didn't I?
刚刚送了大
很惊讶，不是吗？

22:36.827 --> 22:39.931
Oh, well.
Merry early Christmas!
那好吧。
提前圣诞快乐！

22:40.000 --> 22:41.482
- Ho ho ho.
- 嗬嗬嗬。

22:41.551 --> 22:44.793
You're a menace!
- Oh! [clicks tongue]
你是一个威胁！
- 哦！ [咔嚓舌头]

22:47.172 --> 22:50.241
[soft jaunty music]
[轻柔欢快的音乐]

22:50.310 --> 22:57.344
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪